 ("bedding sand", "The clean sand placed under and around a buried pipe to protect it from rocks and settling.", "/services/water-line-replacement/"),
 ("cast iron", "A heavy metal pipe used for sewer and drain lines in many older homes. It can crack, scale and rust through.", "/services/sewer-line-repair/"),
 ("check valve", "A one-way valve that lets water flow in only one direction, used in pool and irrigation plumbing.", "/services/pool-leak-detection/"),
